{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49050","headline":"早春陪敕使麻先生祭岳 · 马令","name":"早春陪敕使麻先生祭岳","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我皇盛文物，道化天地先。\n鞭挞走神鬼，玉帛礼山川。\n忽下袁州使，来游紫洞前。\n青羊得处所，白鹤□时年。\n虔恳飞龙记，昭彰化鸟篇。\n□风半山水，□气总云烟。\n光抱昇中日，霞明五色天。\n山横翠微外，室在绿潭边。\n缇幕灰初庪，焚林火欲然。\n年光着草树，春色换山泉。\n伊水来何日，嵩岩去几千。\n山疑小天下，人是会神仙。\n叶令乘凫入，浮丘驾鹤旋。\n麻姑几年岁，三见海成田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马令","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}